WEBVTT

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.370
Mirror, mirror, on the wall,

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:13.570
who is the fairest of them all?

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:18.530
It is you, my queen, of course.

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:25.540
You always tell the truth, don't you, mirror?

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.620
But that's only the truth for now.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:29.710
What do you mean?

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:37.140
Your daughter will someday 
be more beautiful than you.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:46.760
Like a beautiful flower shedding its petals,

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:49.080
you will gradually age.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:55.750
But your daughter will blossom as she grows.

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:03.440
Curse you... Snow White!

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:38.010
Ex and Snow White

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:38.010
You don't sense a Chaos Teller here?

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:40.400
Then why did we come to this Story Zone?

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:43.340
W-Well... That's a good question!

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:46.110
I see. It's just a coincidence.

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:47.060
It is?

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:50.560
Well, missy's always been bad with directions.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.320
Wh-What do you mean, "always"?

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:53.730
It's not always!

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:55.710
Now, now, you guys...

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:00.290
If there's nothing here, let's go.

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:04.960
With our blank books, there's no telling 
what effect we might have on things here.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.540
Not Chaos Tellers, but...

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:12.880
Maybe some hungry wolves?

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.430
We finally found you!

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:27.900
We found you!

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:33.590
Is there something wrong with my eyes?

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:36.170
I see seven of the same person!

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:38.230
Don't be ridiculous.

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:40.440
There really are seven of them.

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:42.350
That's right!

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:43.490
Right!

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:45.740
They're in perfect harmony.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:47.420
Hey, Prince!

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:51.210
There's no time! You're coming with us!

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.060
Come with us!

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:54.000
Come with you where?

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.210
Also, I'm...

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.380
Grah! No wasting time talking!

00:03:58.640 --> 00:03:59.590
Hey!

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:03.880
Heigh-ho! Heigh-ho! Heigh-ho!

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:10.680
Heigh-ho! Heigh-ho! Heigh-ho!

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:15.310
Where are we?

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:18.320
Hurry! Snow White is in danger!

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:20.730
Snow White? You mean this girl?

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:24.450
Now, Prince, perform the ritual of awakening!

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:26.320
Ritual?

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:27.990
What is that?

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:30.050
Go on! Go on!

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:32.440
"Go on" doesn't tell me anything.

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:34.500
I'm not even a prince...

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.630
Grah! No wasting time talking!

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:41.110
Kid, you okay?!

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:50.060
All right!

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:53.800
Kid, what the hell...

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:56.020
...are you doing?

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.400
Ex, you're...

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:59.140
J-Just wait!

00:04:59.140 --> 00:04:59.860
It's not like that!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.950
I mean, I couldn't help it...

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.320
My prince...?

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:11.370
I've been waiting for you, my prince!

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:15.410
You finally came for me!

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:19.500
And you have such a sweet face!

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:23.510
Wait a second!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.440
No, I won't!

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:27.510
There's no reason to wait anymore!

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.110
How should we do the wedding?

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:30.890
And when?

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.470
Who should we invite?

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:33.640
What food will we serve?

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.140
Where should we hold it?!

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:38.650
I-I'm sorry, I'm... I'm not...

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:42.190
I'm not a prince!

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:45.490
She was fed a poison apple?

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:49.510
Yup. She was asleep for a long time.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:53.540
The only way to wake her 
was with the kiss of a prince!

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.260
That has to be you!

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:58.670
That's what my Book of Fate says!

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:01.630
So... who are these strange people?

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:03.870
"Strange people"? How rude!

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:06.510
I'm Tsuberk, the forest fairy!

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:09.970
I saved Snow White when she 
was lost in the forest.

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:11.760
And the other six?

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:12.900
I'm Tsuberk!

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:13.970
I'm Tsuberk!

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:15.770
Okay, okay. I get it.

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:16.170
I'm Tsuberk! I'm Tsuberk!

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:19.430
Anyway, can you tell me 
more about what happened?

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:20.270
Sure!

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:27.600
Once upon a time, there was a 
beautiful princess named Snow White.

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:31.850
But one day her mother, 
the Queen, became jealous of her

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:35.270
and had her abandoned deep in the forest.

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:39.240
Snow White wandered lost 
and alone through the woods

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:42.210
until she found seven cute Tsuberks...

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.210
That's us!

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:49.880
She lived happily with the Tsuberks in their home.

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:55.560
But then the queen, disguised as an 
old woman, brought Snow White an apple

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.800
that put her into a deep sleep.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:03.060
For it was no normal apple... 
It was poisoned!

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:06.400
Her own mother did that?

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.930
Don't worry!

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:10.290
On the day of Snow White's wedding,

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:13.490
the queen's fated to be forced 
to wear shoes made of burning iron

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:14.990
and dance until she dies!

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:17.580
That's a pretty brutal fate...

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:22.620
Well, your first problem is that our 
boy here looks nothing like a prince.

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:26.260
Well, you're right about that, actually!

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:31.050
It feels like she just kissed the 
wrong guy, though the rest of this

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.050
is going as her Book of Fate says.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:35.410
So coming to this Story Zone...

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:39.520
I guess you'd call it Snow White's 
Story Zone... was a bad idea.

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:42.570
Is it too late to get it back on track?

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:46.020
I think if we leave, it should be fine.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:48.220
You can't do that!

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:50.110
I don't want my prince to leave!

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:54.470
B-But I'm not your prince. My name is Ex...

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:58.160
Prince Ex, then! I don't want 
you to go, Prince Ex!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:01.160
You can't, you can't, you can't!
 I already kissed you!

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:04.540
I gave you my first time, 
so take responsibility!

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:10.760
Wow, if you just listen to what she says, 
Ex sounds like a total jerk.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:13.510
Well, what'll we do, jerk prince?

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:14.460
Knock it off!

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:16.600
Don't try and give me that terrible nickname!

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:19.660
No? Okay, then, loser prince.

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.980
Hey, missy, this is getting out of hand.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.480
Can we just use your tuning to fix it?

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.800
No.

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:29.770
The tuning only works on Chaos Tellers.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:35.200
We'll just have to help restore 
her fate to what it should be.

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:38.490
That'd make us feel a lot better!

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:40.160
Hooray!

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:44.750
Prince Ex! And your retainers, too!

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:48.110
Thank you all for looking after me!

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:52.630
But you know...

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:55.810
I'm not sure what we should do.

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:58.510
Search for the real prince, right?

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:02.890
But we have no idea where he might be.

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:07.000
Then we'll have to get things back
to how they were before we showed up.

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:09.880
And how would you suggest we do that?

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:14.210
The safest thing to do would be to take 
her back to the castle and start over.

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:19.770
I agree! I'll take Prince Ex
 and his retainers to the castle!

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.520
Are you sure about this?

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:27.460
The queen who fed you 
the poison apple is there.

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:30.250
That was one thing, this is another.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.270
I love my mother!

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:35.760
And I want to introduce you to her!

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.010
I-I see...

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:40.120
She's not my real mother,

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:43.270
but she was always so kind to me.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:48.190
Mother, mother! What's
 my prince going to be like?

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:52.070
You'll have to wait to find out.

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:54.530
Aww, that's no fun!

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:58.160
But don't worry. He'll be a wonderful person.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:06.500
Sometimes she would scold me harshly,

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.370
but when I got interested in horses,

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:11.130
she even rode one with me.

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:15.340
Listen carefully, Snow White.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:20.340
As your Book of Fate says, you will one day
 come to hate and try to kill me.

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:25.550
But when the time comes, 
you must not hesitate.

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:28.140
That is my last wish for you.

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:30.170
Mother...

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:34.400
I... I...

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:38.750
I want to stay with you forever!

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:49.210
You're such a kind girl, Snow White.

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:53.930
My mother knew what would happen 
to her because of her Book of Fate,

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:56.300
but loved me a lot anyway.

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:59.680
She was a good mother!

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:04.400
So first mom tries to kill her daughter,

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:08.060
and then the daughter 
ends up killing her mother?

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:12.060
Talk about a crappy fate.

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:15.020
It's none our place to criticize.

00:11:15.470 --> 00:11:20.150
Once we get Snow White to the castle, 
we'll leave the Story Zone quickly.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.530
Snow White is coming?

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:26.330
Yes. She will reach the castle soon.

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:31.480
This doesn't make sense... 
I know she ate that apple.

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:32.970
I'm certain of it.

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:35.290
But it's far too soon for her to be awake yet.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:38.820
I'll just have to...

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:55.400
We're finally here.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:56.110
Yeah!

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:58.320
This is a nice castle.

00:11:58.320 --> 00:11:59.610
Snow White!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.040
Snow White, you're...

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.290
I'm sorry for worrying you!

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:11.200
I know! I need to introduce you!

00:12:11.400 --> 00:12:13.580
This is my beloved Prince Ex,

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.690
and these are his retainers!

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:18.500
Yes, we're all...

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:21.840
Retainers of the idiot prince.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:23.720
The idiot prince?

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:26.290
N-No, we're actually just travelers!

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:28.680
We just brought Snow White home!

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:31.540
Then you're not the real prince?

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:32.640
Th-That's right...

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:36.870
Well, we'll be on our way...

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:38.100
Come on. Let's go.

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:39.870
Wait.

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:44.510
It would shame the royal family if I sent 
my daughter's saviors away empty-handed.

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:47.660
Please stay for a banquet 
at my castle tonight.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:48.740
A banquet?!

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:52.870
We'd love to, but we're in a hurry...

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.590
Right, Reina?

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:55.790
Huh?

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:58.130
Let's go!

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:06.590
Is Snow White going to be okay?

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.590
This is perfect.

00:13:09.590 --> 00:13:15.480
I can just feed her another poison apple 
and everything will go back to how it was.

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:20.070
Yes. You're quite right, my queen.

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:26.910
<i>Oh, no! I don't know what's going on, 
but Snow White is in great danger!</i>

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:28.840
<i>Great danger!</i>

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:41.210
Wow!

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:43.690
Go ahead, everyone. Eat up.

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:45.340
Don't mind if I do!

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:55.730
That was delicious!

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:59.060
Prince Ex, there's still plenty more to eat!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:02.170
Thanks, but I'm full...

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:04.850
Then how about some after-dinner dessert?

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:05.740
Oh, no...

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:08.090
We need to get going.

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:09.200
Yeah.

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.240
Dessert?!

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:11.530
I'm in!

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.670
Very well.

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:17.910
Bring dessert for all of them.

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:25.860
Something sweet is the perfect 
pick-me-up for weary travelers.

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.630
Now, help yourselves.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:30.300
Hey, is this apple...

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:33.430
I have a really bad feeling about this.

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:36.470
It's probably best not to eat it.

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:39.100
It looks absolutely delicious!

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:41.410
Let's dig in!

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:42.990
Hey! Wait, missy!

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:46.170
Oh, are you full? 
Want me to eat yours, too?

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:47.610
No!

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:51.330
Apples from the castle garden...

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:54.700
You served them because you 
knew they're my favorite!

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:56.160
O-Of course.

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:59.080
Hooray! I love you, Mother!

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.250
Let's eat!

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.840
Don't do it!

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.300
Wh-What's this?

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:06.950
We don't know what's going on,

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:10.590
but you can't eat that apple!

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:27.150
I hate my mother!

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:31.420
Snow White...

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:35.330
Don't you hate me?

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:40.120
What? I love you! I could never hate you!

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:41.660
What?

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:47.030
What happened to me?

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:50.300
You ate a poison apple and 
have been asleep all this time!

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:51.550
All this time!

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:55.800
I'll never forgive her for what she did...

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:01.940
I hate my mother!

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:05.140
When I was a Snow White,

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:08.190
I hated my mother so much...

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:10.590
You were the last Snow White?

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:12.450
That's a surprise.

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:16.730
Maybe the apple doesn't just put you to sleep...

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:19.870
Perhaps it also makes you forget
 the love of your mother?

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.250
No way...

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:23.670
What a terrible poison.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:26.130
And because she forgets that love,

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.690
she forces her mother 
to wear shoes of burning iron

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:31.130
and dance herself to death?

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:37.050
Snow White, why don't you try to hate me?

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:41.050
Because you're my mother!

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:43.990
No matter how many poison apples I eat,

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:49.400
I'll never forget how much 
you loved me or how much I love you!

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:52.900
You love... me?

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:56.280
Listen, Snow White.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:58.260
As your Book of Fate says,

00:16:58.260 --> 00:17:01.370
you will one day come 
to hate and try to kill me.

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:06.690
But when the time comes, 
you must not hesitate.

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:09.340
That is my last wish for you.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:11.560
Mother...

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:14.810
I... I...

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:19.800
I want to stay with you forever!

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:30.720
You're such a kind girl, Snow White.

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:35.860
I feel the same way!

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:41.660
I'll always love you! Forever!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:47.080
Yes... Yes, that's right.

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:51.290
My mother loved me so much, too...

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:56.520
But I forgot her love

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:59.520
and let hatred for my own daughter rule me...

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:03.310
What a fool I've been!

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:08.770
Your daughter will someday 
be more beautiful than you.

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:15.590
The mirror brought out the jealousy
 that slumbered deep within me...

00:18:15.590 --> 00:18:17.280
and made it grow.

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:19.580
It's all my fault.

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:24.580
If only I could've stayed innocent, like you...

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:28.790
But I've already killed my mother...

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:34.960
That was one thing, this is another.

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:39.760
What's important is what 
happens in the future, Mother!

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:50.120
Yes, you're right.

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:52.640
Thank you, Snow White.

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:54.520
You are my beloved daughter!

00:18:55.890 --> 00:18:58.880
M-Mother, you're hurting me!

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:00.280
Oh, I'm so sorry!

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:05.600
And now it's my turn to hug you, mother!

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:19.340
I don't know what's going on,
 but I'm so moved!

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:21.760
So moved!

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:22.910
I'm glad...

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:25.230
I guess that's that, huh?

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:29.370
Well, I agree with her that the 
future's more important than the past.

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:30.140
Indeed.

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:34.920
I'm so happy for Snow White and the queen!

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:36.440
So happy!

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:42.380
Wait, didn't you guys deal
 with the last Snow White, too?

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:46.080
How did you forget about all this?

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:54.310
Well, when you live a long time,
you get pretty forgetful!

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:55.590
Pretty forgetful!

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:57.330
Seriously?

00:19:57.330 --> 00:20:00.050
But still... a poison apple and a magic mirror?

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:02.990
That took some serious effort to set up.

00:20:02.990 --> 00:20:06.720
Whoever the Storyteller for this 
zone is, they're a piece of crap.

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:11.110
I'd feel better if we 
just smashed that mirror.

00:20:11.110 --> 00:20:15.040
If you do that, the whole 
Story Zone might collapse.

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:20.770
But why didn't the curse of the poison 
apple work on this Snow White?

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:22.330
It could be...

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:28.100
Ex woke her up before 
the curse took full effect?

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:29.240
It was me?

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:32.710
Coincidence or not... Nice going, kid!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:35.540
Turns out you're more 
than just a dunce of a prince.

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:39.250
Yeah. Not bad for a loser prince.

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:42.190
Th-Thanks...

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:46.530
I don't know what will happen to us next,

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:50.890
but both Snow White and I will try to 
remember the love we have for one another.

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:53.910
It's all thanks to you.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:58.020
Well, it's goodbye for real
 this time, Snow White.

00:20:58.260 --> 00:21:00.050
Uh... Um...

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:01.860
I'm sorry!

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:03.280
What's wrong?

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:09.800
I knew from the start that 
you weren't my prince.

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:11.880
Because, um...

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:15.870
You were so wonderful...

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:21.170
Snow White, I'm sure you'll find a prince 
much more wonderful than me someday.

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:22.550
Okay!

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:26.090
And when I marry him...

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:30.930
Mother, I want you to do that 
dance in your burning shoes!

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:35.710
No, um...

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:40.690
Snow White, don't you love me?

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:43.940
That was one thing, Mother. 
This is another.

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:53.590
I guess they're going back to the 
fates they're supposed to have,

00:21:53.590 --> 00:21:55.960
but is the queen gonna be okay?

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:57.890
I think so.

00:21:57.890 --> 00:21:59.330
When I left, she whispered to me...

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:01.980
That was a joke.

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:07.340
I'll try to find a way to save her without 
changing my Book of Fate too much.

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:08.720
That's what she said.

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:12.720
Yeah? That little princess is pretty smart.

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:16.400
Anyway, our work is done here.

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:17.860
Let's go.

00:22:17.860 --> 00:22:19.230
I agree.

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:23.730
But sometimes... fate is cruel, isn't it?

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:28.550
Well, the next Story Zone is waiting.

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:31.210
Try taking us to the right place this time!

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:33.350
I know that!
